      "text": "Continuous refills a free slot in the very next pass, so its 90 idle slot-steps sit in the tail. Wall time\ngains less than passes: the prompt steps take about 10.5 s in both runs, the same 10,166 prompt tokens, and\nonly the decode-only passes shrink, 127 to 87, each carrying more rows.",
