        "anchor": [
          0,
          8611.5,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "At budget 2048 the whole 1,132-token prompt rides in one step, and the worst gap between a reply's tokens is\n1,089 ms. Decodes take the budget first, so at 512 the prompt goes in as 508, 508 and 116. At 128 the worst gap\nfalls to 298 ms while turn 4 waits 1,969 ms for its first token: the budget trades one for the other.",
      "originalText": "At budget 2048 the whole 1,132-token prompt rides in one step, and the worst gap between a reply's tokens is\n1,089 ms. Decodes take the budget first, so at 512 the prompt goes in as 508, 508 and 116. At 128 the worst gap\nfalls to 298 ms while turn 4 waits 1,969 ms for its first token: the budget trades one for the other.",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
