        "section": "7-preemption",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          10239.8,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "A reply grows, so a running request can find no block for its next token. Evicting by recompute keeps every\ntoken and costs one prefill; admitting on the first chunk alone thrashes, 6 to 12 evictions instead of one.",
