    },
    {
      "id": "9-in-flight-874",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1380,
      "y": 12353.1,
      "width": 661.44,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3695470355,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1837905937,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794883837770,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "9-in-flight",
        "anchor": [
          1380,
          12353.1,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "reading a result waits for every op queued before it,\nso nothing overlaps: the gain is simulated.\nhost work here is 0.1 ms of a 220 ms step.\nbetween runs, depth 0 alone took 10.6 to 23.0 s:\nmore than any gap between the depths",
      "originalText": "reading a result waits for every op queued before it,\nso nothing overlaps: the gain is simulated.\nhost work here is 0.1 ms of a 220 ms step.\nbetween runs, depth 0 alone took 10.6 to 23.0 s:\nmore than any gap between the depths",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bD6"
    },
    {
      "id": "9-in-flight-875",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1380,
      "y": 12533.1,
      "width": 686.4,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1127615174,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 713018751,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794883837770,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "9-in-flight",
        "anchor": [
          1380,
          12533.1,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "on a GPU the device idles while the host plans the next\nstep; a production engine's comment warns a busy CPU\ncan significantly slow its kernel launches",
      "originalText": "on a GPU the device idles while the host plans the next\nstep; a production engine's comment warns a busy CPU\ncan significantly slow its kernel launches",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bD7"
    },
    {
      "id": "9-in-flight-876",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 13046.3,
      "width": 1684.8,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2493155741,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 407703025,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794883837770,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "9-in-flight",
        "anchor": [
          0,
          13046.3,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Launching the next step before reading this one's tokens hides the host's planning behind the device's work.\nIt costs one wasted token per turn: 148 sampled to keep 143. On this Mac a read waits for everything queued,\nso the gain is simulated: 219.7 ms a step against 219.9, 0.1% less.",
      "originalText": "Launching the next step before reading this one's tokens hides the host's planning behind the device's work.\nIt costs one wasted token per turn: 148 sampled to keep 143. On this Mac a read waits for everything queued,\nso the gain is simulated: 219.7 ms a step against 219.9, 0.1% less.",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "bD8"
    },
